    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>erotic SRPG</strong> where combat and gameplay shape the narrative. You play as an outlaw embarking on a desperate quest. You are joined by <strong>your girlfriend</strong>, <strong>your best friend</strong>, and <strong>a powerful sorceress</strong>. While you may all be on the same journey, your destinations will be anything but similar. You will encounter obstacles and opponents that will push your relationships to their breaking point. How will the tapestry of your fates unfold?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575420/extras/250d6e98f02e45a765df145577701801.avif?t=1754316461\" width=600 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each party member's perspective features unique content and scenarios. From a banished noble trying to win the <strong>love</strong> of his childhood friend, an earnest maiden on a journey of <strong>self discovery</strong>, a charismatic rogue attempting to grow his <strong>harem</strong>, and a manipulative sorceress intent on <strong>controlling all of those around her</strong>- who will be successful in their aims?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575420/extras/c44b43cb947f06e039bda31f81bddd1c.avif?t=1754316461\" width=600 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Netoria Tactics 2  features a <strong>new setting</strong>, <strong>new story</strong>, and <strong>new characters</strong>- <u><strong>knowledge of the original game is NOT REQUIRED</strong></u> to enjoy this new chapter of cuckold conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSPECTIVE CHOICE:</strong> Each party member has their own goals, rivals, and scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE:</strong> Want to skip the combat? Now you can! Experience the game as a VN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MECHANICS DRIVEN:</strong> Choices in combat affect the character's relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD CHOICE:</strong> The new skill system allows you to tweak and customize your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GENDER BENDING:</strong> Male to female, female to male, and even intersex transformations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
