CTIVE CHOICE:</strong> Each party member has their own goals, rivals, and scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE:</strong> Want to skip the combat? Now you can! Experience the game as a VN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MECHANICS DRIVEN:</strong> Choices in combat affect the character's relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD CHOICE:</strong> The new skill system allows you to tweak and customize your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GENDER BENDING:</strong> Male to female, female to male, and even intersex transformations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
